{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S09-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"喘息退去、迟疑回返承接了前段对失去喘息的预感，而重新面对问题却不再全然茫然，也对应了珠子中旧问题重现但经历已不同的变化。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"不必防备、能够安心亲近的生活有前段明确铺垫，仍未选出下一步也符合珠子中问题重现却没有简单答案的状态，没有新增具体事实或把音乐变化当作心理原因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S09-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"前条已经写出他预感喘息将要失去，后条喘息退去、熟悉的迟疑回返是自然的后续。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"前条明确说出他向往不必防备、无需争夺便能留住珍贵之物的生活，直接说明了后条他认出的向往是什么。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"两条线交代了喘息消退、旧有迟疑回返、如今已认出自己珍惜的生活却仍不能决定下一步，整体心理走向清楚。\",\n\n  \"lost\": [],\n\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S09-2\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"“想到的已是那种生活”与“知道自己舍不得什么”部分重复表达同一认识，分号又把这一判断与尚未决定下一步串在一起；“仍没替他选出下一步”的主语也不够明确。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a9ccd979-a1ff-4a76-b870-502bc011ea7c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T062823938422Z", "elapsed_seconds": 192.125, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T06:31:36.080667+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b211b18921c2c500a281d1cfea247adf161d494121e09d99de1bed6673d10c80", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "acco